{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:023a27a185a19c97","name":"Mounted Regiment","source":{"id":"source:reference-023a27a185a19c97","title":"Mounted Regiment","revision":20908,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:46:17Z","sha256":"75ca2d1efe13c2a7f6160a51d976042f6f3c8fa4e1ee8eb823f5a205def6034d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20908","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mounted%20Regiment&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-023a27a185a19c97","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You and your allies act as mounted cavalry, specializing in using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beasts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beasts"}," in war.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You gain a +3 competence bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," checks. At the time you make a check, for each ally within 12 squares of you who also has this feat, the competence bonus increases by +1 (to a maximum of +7).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, once per round as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to your mount being attacked, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," check; if the result exceeds the mount's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", use your check result against the attack instead of using the mount's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
